{'symbol': 'GOOG', 'date': '2022-10-10 13:00:00', 'title': 'PRUDENTIAL PLC AND GOOGLE CLOUD ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO MAKE HEALTHCARE AND FINANCIAL SECURITY MORE ACCESSIBLE ACROSS ASIA AND AFRICA', 'text': "HONG KONG, AND LONDON, AND NEW YORK, AND SINGAPORE , OCT. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEADING INSURANCE GROUP, PRUDENTIAL PLC (PRUDENTIAL) AND GOOGLE CLOUD TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO ENHANCE HEALTH AND FINANCIAL INCLUSION FOR COMMUNITIES ACROSS ASIA AND AFRICA.\xa0 UNDER THIS ALLIANCE, PRUDENTIAL WILL LEVERAGE GOOGLE CLOUD'S DATA ANALYTICS CAPABILITIES, SECURE AND SUSTAINABLE INFRASTRUCTURE, AND THE BROADER GOOGLE ECOSYSTEM, TO ACCELERATE ITS DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION AND TO ENHANCE USER ENGAGEMENT OF ITS HEALTH AND WEALTH PLATFORM, PULSE."}